---
import { pbeExchangeEnhancement, PBE_KAPPA, PBE_MU } from '../../../data/part02/ch08TeachingModels.mjs';

const samples = Array.from({ length: 241 }, (_, index) => {
  const s = (6 * index) / 240;
  return { s, value: pbeExchangeEnhancement(s) };
});
const xScale = (s) => 55 + (s / 6) * 650;
const yScale = (value) => 240 - ((value - 0.9) / 0.95) * 175;
const path = samples.map((point, index) =>
  `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xScale(point.s).toFixed(2)} ${yScale(point.value).toFixed(2)}`,
).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual gga-enhancement" data-gga-enhancement>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：PBE 型交换增强因子与约束</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: PBE-type exchange enhancement factor and constraints</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>reduced gradient s</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="6" step="0.05" value="1" data-gga-s />
      <output data-gga-s-output>1.00</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="gga-title gga-desc">
    <title id="gga-title">PBE-type exchange enhancement factor as a function of reduced gradient</title>
    <desc id="gga-desc">The enhancement factor begins at one, has a quadratic small-gradient correction, and approaches one plus kappa.</desc>
    <line x1="55" y1="240" x2="705" y2="240" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="55" y1="45" x2="55" y2="240" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="55" y1="60" x2="705" y2="60" class="gga-enhancement__limit" />
    <path d={path} class="gga-enhancement__curve" />
    <circle cx={xScale(1)} cy={yScale(pbeExchangeEnhancement(1))} r="5" class="gga-enhancement__marker" data-gga-marker />
    <text x="705" y="270" text-anchor="end">s</text>
    <text x="20" y="55">Fx(s)</text>
    <text x="700" y="52" text-anchor="end">1+κ</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <strong data-gga-fx>Fx(1.00) = {pbeExchangeEnhancement(1).toFixed(8)}</strong>
    <span>κ = {PBE_KAPPA}, μ = {PBE_MU.toFixed(8)}</span>
    <span data-gga-bound>0 ≤ Fx−1 &lt; κ</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>Fx(s)=1+κ−κ/[1+μs²/κ]，采用 PBE 交换参数 κ=0.804、μ≈0.219515。s=|∇n|/(2kFn) 为无量纲 reduced gradient。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> the PBE exchange enhancement form is evaluated with its standard κ and μ parameters and the dimensionless reduced gradient.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>Fx(0)=1；小 s 极限为 1+μs²+O(s⁴)；Fx 随 s 单调增加并严格低于 1+κ；s→∞ 时趋于 1+κ。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> Fx(0)=1, the leading small-gradient correction is μs², the factor grows monotonically below 1+κ, and approaches that bound at large s.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这里只展示一种 exchange enhancement 结构，不含 PBE correlation、spin dependence 或真实密度。满足这些约束不意味着对所有性质优于 LDA，也不构成对其他 GGA 的排序。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> only one exchange enhancement form is shown. Correlation, spin, and material densities are absent, and constraint satisfaction does not imply universal superiority.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { pbeExchangeEnhancement, PBE_KAPPA } from '../../../data/part02/ch08TeachingModels.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-gga-enhancement]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-gga-s]');
    const marker = root.querySelector('[data-gga-marker]');
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(marker instanceof SVGCircleElement)) return;
    const xScale = (s) => 55 + (s / 6) * 650;
    const yScale = (value) => 240 - ((value - 0.9) / 0.95) * 175;
    const update = () => {
      const s = Number(input.value);
      const fx = pbeExchangeEnhancement(s);
      marker.setAttribute('cx', xScale(s).toFixed(2));
      marker.setAttribute('cy', yScale(fx).toFixed(2));
      const sOutput = root.querySelector('[data-gga-s-output]');
      if (sOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) sOutput.value = s.toFixed(2);
      const fxOutput = root.querySelector('[data-gga-fx]');
      if (fxOutput instanceof HTMLElement) fxOutput.textContent = `Fx(${s.toFixed(2)}) = ${fx.toFixed(8)}`;
      const bound = root.querySelector('[data-gga-bound]');
      if (bound instanceof HTMLElement) bound.textContent = `Fx−1 = ${(fx - 1).toFixed(8)} < κ = ${PBE_KAPPA}`;
    };
    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .gga-enhancement svg { width: 100%; max-height: 23rem; }
  .gga-enhancement text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 14px; }
  .gga-enhancement__curve { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent); stroke-width: 3.5; }
  .gga-enhancement__limit { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 7 5; }
  .gga-enhancement__marker { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke: var(--sl-color-bg); stroke-width: 2; }
</style>
